  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Persecution Prospect",
    "summary": "After being **selected to shoot** in [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), this unit can pick an enemy unit, other than a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit. Then:\n\n- its models' attacks can target nothing but that enemy unit, which must be an eligible target, for the rest of the phase\n- once those attacks are resolved, if any of them hit that enemy unit, it is assailed until [your next Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase); assailed is only a label, used by this ability and by some Stratagems and Enhancements\n- if that enemy unit was assailed already, it is also pinned until then\n\nA pinned unit gets -2\" M and -2 to its [Charge rolls](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step).",
